WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.367
Seven dwarfs stomped into the house.

2
00:00:09.368 --> 00:00:13.047
Picks and bags fell to the floor.

3
00:00:13.048 --> 00:00:15.612
"Whew!" one dwarf said.

4
00:00:15.613 --> 00:00:18.616
"Working in the mines is hard work.

5
00:00:18.617 --> 00:00:21.630
I'm starving!"

6
00:00:21.631 --> 00:00:25.041
"Me too," the second dwarf said.

7
00:00:25.042 --> 00:00:29.327
The third dwarf nodded. "And me!"

8
00:00:29.328 --> 00:00:32.700
The dwarfs sat down at the table.

9
00:00:32.701 --> 00:00:36.218
"Um . . ." The fourth dwarf stared at his plate.

10
00:00:36.219 --> 00:00:37.997
"Where's my dinner?"

11
00:00:37.998 --> 00:00:40.618
The other dwarfs looked at their plates.

12
00:00:40.619 --> 00:00:45.246
There were seven gasps.

13
00:00:45.247 --> 00:00:48.153
The fifth dwarf jumped out of his chair.

14
00:00:48.154 --> 00:00:53.148
"Somebody robbed us!"

15
00:00:53.149 --> 00:00:57.355
The seven dwarfs looked under furniture.

16
00:00:57.356 --> 00:01:00.376
They peeked inside the cupboard.

17
00:01:00.377 --> 00:01:04.270
"I don't see anyone," the sixth dwarf said.

18
00:01:04.271 --> 00:01:11.688
"And nothing else is missing."

19
00:01:11.689 --> 00:01:21.525
Next the dwarfs searched their dark bedroom.

20
00:01:21.526 --> 00:01:24.649
"Ouch! Who stepped on my foot?"

21
00:01:24.650 --> 00:01:26.972
"Sorry, I—oof!"

22
00:01:26.973 --> 00:01:28.877
"Pardon me!"

23
00:01:28.878 --> 00:01:32.297
"Shh!" the seventh dwarf said.

24
00:01:32.298 --> 00:01:35.912
"Someone is sleeping in my bed!"

25
00:01:35.913 --> 00:01:39.528
He held out a candle.

26
00:01:39.529 --> 00:01:45.722
The six other dwarfs hurried over.

27
00:01:45.723 --> 00:01:48.596
They peered at Snow White.

28
00:01:48.597 --> 00:01:52.682
"She's beautiful," one said.

29
00:01:52.683 --> 00:01:56.333
"Should we wake her?" another asked.

30
00:01:56.334 --> 00:02:01.422
The first dwarf shook his head. "Let her sleep."

31
00:02:01.423 --> 00:02:04.393
The seventh dwarf looked around.

32
00:02:04.394 --> 00:02:07.238
"But I don't have a bed."

33
00:02:07.239 --> 00:02:09.294
The first dwarf shrugged.

34
00:02:09.295 --> 00:02:12.375
"We have six other beds.

35
00:02:12.376 --> 00:02:16.454
You can sleep in each one for an hour."

36
00:02:16.455 --> 00:02:24.736
"Okay," the seventh dwarf mumbled.

